WEBVTT

00:01:00.076 --> 00:01:03.556
What was missing from the sea
of my childhood was there.

00:01:03.876 --> 00:01:08.156
Groupers, sea bass, octopus,
scorpion fish, seaweed forests.

00:01:08.796 --> 00:01:12.196
Just a few years of protection
had allowed the sea to bounce back.

00:01:13.956 --> 00:01:16.996
I have seen this miracle happen in other
areas across the ocean,

00:01:17.036 --> 00:01:19.076
like in Cabo Pulmo, Mexico,

00:01:19.076 --> 00:01:24.516
where local fishermen were so upset
with not having enough fish to catch,

00:01:24.556 --> 00:01:25.716
that in the mid-'90s,

00:01:25.756 --> 00:01:28.836
they asked the Mexican government
to create a no-take area.

00:01:29.636 --> 00:01:31.876
A national park in the sea.